      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present 95 Cedarbrook Avenue, Cherry Orchard, Dublin 10 to the market a superb two-bedroom, two-bathroom own door duplex apartment presented in turnkey condition throughout and ideally positioned within this modern and ever-popular residential development. Cedarbrook continues to grow in popularity thanks to its excellent connectivity and abundance of nearby amenities including local shops, cafés, supermarkets and recreational facilities, while Liffey Valley Shopping Centre is just a short drive away. The location is exceptionally well served by public transport with Park West and Cherry Orchard train station less than a five-minute walk away, offering regular services to Dublin City Centre and beyond. The N4, M50 and major road networks are also easily accessible.\n\nBright and spacious internal living accommodation spans to a generous c. 67 sqm, comprises of private own door entrance, entrance hallway, generous open plan lounge/dining area, fully fitted kitchen and guest W/C on the first floor, while upstairs hosts two well-proportioned double bedrooms, and a family bathroom. The property is enhanced by impressive high ceilings and large windows, creating a bright, airy and welcoming living environment throughout.\n\nNo. 95 is presented in true turnkey condition, allowing the successful purchaser to move straight in with nothing further to do. Additional benefits include designated parking and the added advantage of no onward chain, ensuring a smooth and straightforward transaction.\n\nThis fantastic home is perfectly suited to first time buyers, investors and those looking to downsize, offering stylish accommodation, excellent transport links and a highly convenient location. Early viewing is highly recommended contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today on 086 130 4080 or 01 224 1630 to arrange a viewing.\n\nAdditional Features;\n• c. 67 sqm\n• BER B\n• 2 Bed / 2 Bath\n• Own door duplex\n• Management fees c. 1,400\n• Designated parking\n• Electric heating\n• Double glazed windows\n• Fully fitted kitchen\n• Private balcony\n• 5-minute walk to the Train Station\n• Plenty of bus routes on your doorstep\n• No onwards chain\n• Bright and airy\n• High ceilings\n• Well-proportioned layout throughout\n• Wide range of local amenities within walking distance\n• Highly sought after location\n• Ideal for first time buyers, downsizers, and investors\n• Viewing highly advised\n\nMeasurements;\nLiving Room: 3.38m X 3.54m.\nKitchen: 3.38m X 2.33m.\nBedroom 1: 3.26m X 3.09m.\nBedroom 2: 3.26m X 2.68m.\nW/C: 1.98m X 1.02m.\nBathroom: 2.09m X 1.65m.\n\nDirections;\nEircode: D10 KE55"
      },
      {
